      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e1",
      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_5",
      "quote": "The studies were eligible for inclusion if they met the following criteria: (1) Patients who suffered and were treated for an extra-articular distal radius fracture; (2) age 18 years or older; (3) patients were either treated using a plaster cast, K-wire(s), plate fixation, external fixator, or an intramedullary device; (4) primary data for at least one outcome parameter had to be available.",
      "reason": "The eligibility criteria for study characteristics (population age, fracture type, intervention types, and requirement for outcome data) are specified, but there is no explicit description of eligible study designs, settings, or follow-up requirements."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e2",
      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_4",
      "quote": "No language limits were used and any potentially eligible non-English language manuscripts were translated if possible by native speaking colleagues or using Google translate, if no native speaker was available.",
      "reason": "Language restrictions (none) and handling of non-English manuscripts are reported, but there is no information on dissemination year or publication/report status."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e3",
      "status": "MISSING",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "The provided evidence does not report how exclusions were distinguished (outcomes not measured vs outcome results not reported)."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e4",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_7",
      "quote": "These 136 cohorts consisted of a total of 6707 patients divided over the five different treatment modalities. ... All outcome data were pooled for four different follow-up periods: 0-3 months, > 3-6 months, > 6-12 months, and 12 months or longer (long term).",
      "reason": "The manuscript specifies the grouping used for synthesis as five treatment modalities and pooling across four follow-up periods."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e5",
      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_6",
      "quote": "Studies describing a not-commonly used device or technique for extra-articular fractures were excluded ( i.e. dorsal plates, Epibloc system, cannulated screw, above elbow cast, etc.).",
      "reason": "A restriction is described (excluding not-commonly used devices/techniques), but the evidence does not provide full rationales for all notable eligibility restrictions."
    }
